\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces All-class Dice (\%), averaged over folds and over all held-out test contrasts/datasets per setting (3-fold cross-validation). \emph  {Base} = no-augmentation; \emph  {noEM}/\emph  {EM} = the SynthSeg variants of \cref  {subsec:e-setup}; \emph  {Auglab}\nobreakspace  {}\cite  {molinier2026auglab} is the strongest competing method; \textbf  {Ours} = PALETTE applied on top of the Auglab pipeline. Best per row in bold. $^{\dagger }$ marks settings where \textbf  {Ours} beats Auglab by a case-level Wilcoxon signed-rank test with Holm correction ($p<0.05$); this holds in six of eight settings (all except Brats2024-GLI T1n, $p=0.64$, and Open-MS T1w, $p=0.15$).\relax }}{6}{table.caption.10}\protected@file@percent }
